summary:
  A balance the widget works out by itself is held to the 5 % a row's
  slider starts at.

history:
  Room 10 %, widget 80 %, balance 0.1: the device stands at 0.008. Without
  this computer the same loudness is a balance of 0.01; held at 0.05, one
  notch down on the wheel sent the device 0.038.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TransportLogic.js

find:
      return Math.max(0.001, Math.min(1, Math.floor(exact * 1e6 + 1e-3) / 1e6));

replace:
      return Math.max(0.05, Math.min(1, Math.floor(exact * 1e6 + 1e-3) / 1e6));

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_transportlogic.qml::test_leaving_a_quiet_room_does_not_raise_the_device
  and tests/qml/tst_volumeroad.qml::test_leaving_a_quiet_room_does_not_raise_the_television.
  Line-neutral.
